{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の事 皆のコメントで知りました...\n我が家は大丈夫です\n心配してくれてありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリして..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"亡くなられた方のご冥福をお祈りします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや家族の方も広島の方もいるし、\n実家が広島って方もいるので心配です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木のの で一緒だった きいちゃん\nいろんな話をしてくれる 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもこの二人は子どもみたい子どもみたいと言われる二人です......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日8月21日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46結成三年目です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３年前の今日オーディションに合格して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13才で まさか一人東京に上京してくるようになるなんて全く想像もしていなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山と田んぼに囲まれて、太陽大好きで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも真っ黒になって遊んでた普通の女の子だった！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかアイドルになるなんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも支えてくれる皆がいたから\n今の まあやがここに立っていられます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントくれたり、握手会に会いに来てくれたり、\nライブにお花を送ってくれたり、生誕祭をしてもらえたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆に出逢えた事が一番の宝物です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前お母さんから言われた言葉が、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは不器用で隠れて泣くような子だったけど、変わってきたね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って\nそうなれたのも皆のおかげだね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って\n本当にそう思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも応援してもらえるよう\n乃木坂も学業も頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡に来てくれた皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はどうでしたか？\n凄い盛り上がってもらえて楽しくライヴ出来ました〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ物も美味しかったよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"博多ラーメンにめんたいこー♪♪(ｏ・ω・)ノ))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん 真夏ちゃん誕生日おめでとう(^○^)\n素敵な１年になりますように♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏ちゃんもまいやんもいつもまあやを気にかけて沢山話しかけてきてくれてありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんにはまいやんが誕生日なのにめちゃめちゃ美味しいアイスかってもらっちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒石さんと真夏ちゃんのコンビすきっo(*⌒―⌒*)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてWまあやとして親友のGEM武田舞彩も誕生日迎えたねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５時間以上話続けたこともある！一緒にいてほんとに飽きないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目はめちゃかわいいのにすっごい面白いギャップが大好き♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になりますように♪LOVE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごくまとまりないblogだけど、\nこうして結成三年目を迎えることができて幸せです(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長かったようであっという間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶっちゃけすっごく辛くてくじけそうになった時もあったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様の支えがあって、メンバーの支えがあって、家族や友達、スタッフさんの皆様の支えがあって\nこの三年目という日を迎えれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にまだまだ未熟者ですが\nこれからも頑張ります！よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46！これからも大きくなれるよう皆と一致団結していきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にみんな仲良くて家族みたいなみんなに出会えて感謝です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思うことはたっくさんあるのですがなんて伝えたらいいかわかんない〜(。>д<)笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも乃木坂46に出会えて良かった♪\n皆様に出会えて良かった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大大大大大大大大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/08/21/3313457/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月21日       和田まあや"}],"source":"archive"}